Proof.
intros Hsh1Block HPDTIfPDFlag HmultIsPDT HwellSh1 HnoDupTree HlookupPart HlookupBlock HPflag HpropsOr Hs1
  HflagProp part block parentBlock HpartIsPart HPBMapped HblockIsBE HsceInRange.
