intros HPDTIfPDFlag HmultIsPDT HwellSh1 HnoDupTree HPDchildIsPart HlookupPd HlookupBlock HflagOr HpropsOr Hs1
  part block sh1entryaddr idchild HpartIsPart HblockMapped Hsh1 HPDchild HbeqChildNull.
