revert bentryBase. revert blockBase. revert buildPart. revert pdentryBuild. revert parentsList. revert s0.
induction statesList; simpl; intros s0 parentsList pdentryBuild buildPart blockBase bentryBase HchildBlockProps
  Hdisjoint HwellFormedShadow HnoDup HwellFormedBlock HaccessPD HPDTIfPDFlag HmultPDT HisChild HnoDupTree
  HparentIsPart HpartIsolation Hnull HbuildIsPart HlookupBuild HlookupBlockBase HPFlagBase HbeqSlistEmpty
  HblockBaseMapped HstartBase HendBase HisBuilt; try(exfalso; congruence).
