        specialize(HPI pdAddr child buildPart HpdAddrIsPart HchildIsChild HbuildPartIsChild
                    HbeqChildBuild startChild HstartInChild).
        contradict HPI. unfold getUsedPaddr. apply in_or_app. right. assumption.
